# What the old body's ground documents say: axioms, north star, principles. Study report: 2.6.1. Sources: 2.1.x, 2.6.x and 2.7.21.

n: 3.3
name: ground-documents
kind: hub
is: The old body's ground: five axioms whose text was rewritten on 2026-11-08 and whose file holds the count of five open; 20 theorems proved by naming axioms; two derivation files; a north star measured in rented tokens. The study sorts 59 principles into 24 fixed with the axioms, 9 directions and 26 movable practices. The C seed meant to shrink grew from 25,483 to 34,149 lines. Two shipped files disagree on whether 0 means fail, and no ground document says whether a result is 1 with a payload or a node.
